+# API Specialist Gate Review: KANBA-132 (KB-P4-13)
+
+- **Ticket**: `KANBA-132` (`KB-P4-13`: `[Phase 4 / MCP] Ephemeral kb_agt_eph_* read-only MCP tokens (execution_id, Invoker ∩ Agent ∩ Project, TTL<=120s, max_calls<=25)`)
